SUMMARY:Coastal Glass Art Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Design your own shimmering seaside keepsake in this 2-hour epoxy-resin art workshop led by professional artist Elena Lagana at Southern Market. You’ll create a framed 9″ x 11″ glass piece featuring your choice of a mermaid\, seahorse\, or starfish as the centerpiece.\n\nUsing crushed glass\, natural shells\, stones\, and more\, you’ll build a textured coastal scene before learning how to mix and pour epoxy resin for a smooth\, glass-like finish that makes your design come alive. Gloves are provided\, and you’ll wear an N95 mask only during the resin-pouring portion. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Buy Tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/coastal-glass-art-workshop/
LOCATION:Southern Market\, 100 South Queen Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/06/SMC2605_06-June-Art-Workshop-Web-300.avif
END:VEVENT
