SUMMARY:Beginning Character Design Workshop: Grades 6-9 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Join us at PCA&D in this one day workshop for students in grades 6-9 as we learn to develop and create our very own characters! We will be breaking down the process of how to start developing characters from start to finish including developing their backstory and persona. This is a studio based class with some guidance and lot’s of creative freedom. Expect to have individual work time and one-on-one guidance! Register today! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/beginning-character-design-workshop-grades-6-9-at-pcad/
